+# S5-CLM-00003486
+
+This directory is the target-local handoff for the Curling Number Conjecture,
+owned only by `S5CON-00003486-TARGET--worker`.
+
+The package binds the exact source declaration and preserves its open status.
+`Statement.lean` transports the source definitions and proposition; `Proof.lean`
+contains checked singleton/nonemptiness lemmas; `Exploration.lean` and
+`research/attempt-001.json` record bounded positive-budget exploration; the
+resolution, human, machine, readability, and validation receipts describe the
+remaining debt.
+
+Current state: **exploration package accepted pending canonical Master review**.
+The conjecture is not proved or refuted. Mapping, human, machine, and readable
+cuts remain open, so no underscore-to-x transition is authorized.
+
+Start with `intake.json`, `statement-crosswalk.json`, `frontier.md`, and
+`full-study.md`. Artifact hashes and the frozen self-test handoff are in the
+worker outbox one directory above this instance.
